cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use certkkt, please cite it as below."
title: certkkt
abstract: >-
  Exact rational-arithmetic optimality certificates for LP, QP and SOCP solutions:
  certify or refute primal and dual feasibility, cone membership, duality gap and
  complementarity of a solver's floating-point output, and repair near-optimal points
  into exact certificates.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: h-a-forster
repository-code: "https://github.com/h-a-forster/certkkt"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-30"
keywords:
  - convex optimization
  - second-order cone programming
  - quadratic programming
  - exact arithmetic
  - verification
  - KKT conditions
